    in-app Resources page and must stay there. See
    `backend/src/lib/resources/ATTRIBUTION.md` for the full attribution and the
    regeneration procedure.

Dependencies installed from package registries are not vendored into this
repository and carry their own licenses. Review them before redistributing a
built artifact.


A NOTE FOR ANYONE OPERATING THIS AS A SERVICE
---------------------------------------------

Section 13 of the AGPL applies to this application. If you run a modified
version and let users interact with it over a network, those users must be
offered the Corresponding Source of your modified version — publishing a
repository and linking to it from the running application is the usual way to
satisfy this. Deploying an unmodified copy from a public repository already
satisfies it; deploying private modifications without an offer of source does
not.
